cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below,
  as well as the primary research paper listed in preferred-citation.

title: "DEMETRA Hyperspectral & NIR Leaf Spectral Dataset"
abstract: >
  Leaf-level full-range (400–2500 nm) reflectance spectra collected with a
  FieldSpec 4 spectroradiometer, co-registered with wet-chemistry nutrient
  assays (N, P, K, Ca, Mg, S, chlorophyll / SPAD index) across multiple
  Sicilian crop species and growth stages. Acquired under the DEMETRA
  national research programme (PNRR Agriculture 4.0).

version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2024-01-01"   # update with actual release date

license: CC-BY-4.0

repository-code: "https://github.com/Demetra-UNIME-CNR/Demetra-UNIME-CNR.github.io"
url: "https://demetra-unime-cnr.github.io"

authors:
